<speak>Thank you, Mr Tan. For the housekeeping, keep any bank correspondence you receive in the place you've chosen for those records. If you have trouble locating a document, use the bank's established contact channel and describe the navigation issue without sending sensitive information through an informal message. You can also keep a short note of the administrative question you want help with, so you don't have to explain the whole filing story again. There is no need to remain logged in waiting for something.</speak>